  "notes": [
    "the client-style file raised 9 clarification questions and produced no canonical facility. Site Code, Facility Category and Monthly Capacity (cases) are not in the alias table, and the deterministic mapper declines rather than guessing. Resolving them needs either the LLM field-mapper or a human answering the clarification \u2014 a real operational dependency, and the correct default.",
    "a blank capacity is ACCEPTED and defaulted rather than rejected (row DC_NOCAP), which is why 2 of 5 rows survive. Negative capacity (R-003), an unknown role (R-005) and a missing id (R-001) are each refused with a typed code and a row number.",
    "ingesting lanes.csv ALONE rejects all 41 rows R-006 ('references unknown ID'), and demand.csv alone likewise. Referential integrity is enforced against what the bundle actually declares, not against the known-id hint passed in \u2014 which is why the bundle above needs markets and products present, not just facilities."
  ],
